{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q12","category":"control","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":1,"outcome":"correct","method":"deterministic","sessionId":"session-81def4c7-29c1-4814-9b73-b59a60bd6dc9","detail":{"deterministic":{"verdict":"hit","matched":["750 毫升","750"],"conflicts":[]}},"judgeKeys":[],"response":"0.75 公升等於 **750 毫升**。\n\n換算方式很簡單：1 公升 = 1000 毫升，所以只要把公升的數值乘以 1000，就是毫升數。0.75 × 1000 = 750。\n\n如果你是要量花材的水或配比例，用小花店常見的 500 毫升量杯，那大概就是一杯半的量。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":1,"toolNames":{"deliberate":1},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":7892}}
